# Atmos TRS — LGU + reports workflow

Primary work **begins at LGU tourism and DOT/OPTACA reporting**. Upstream (tourist signup, QR) and downstream (Governor) are context unless the user expands scope.

Full product agreements: `docs/atmos-forms-and-establishment-qr.md`.

## Role → surface

| Role | Starts at | Notes |
|------|-----------|--------|
| LGU tourism | `tourism_dashboard.dart` | Primary — tourists, analytics, DOT export, OPTACA submit, debug seed |
| Provincial / OPTACA | Provincial dashboard + `optaca_report_review_panel` | Inbox/review primary |
| Tourist | Home / QR | Visit data source; seed mid-report work |
| Governor | Governor dashboard | Aggregates from real/seeded data |
| Establishment | `establishment_dashboard_*` | DAE-1B Daily Register + Insights (`ae_register_service`, `lib/widgets/ae_register/`) |

Keep Filipino vs foreign, municipality vs province, spot vs LGU check-ins vs **hotel register** data distinguishable.

## Data flow

Tourist registered → QR (attraction / LGU) → LGU analytics → DOT preview + Excel/PDF → optional OPTACA package → Governor aggregates.

## DOT export (Analytics)

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Preview | **Every** catalog form — best-fill from current data + gaps |
| Downloads | **Excel** and **PDF** of that filled content (primary CTAs) |
| Blank official | Secondary/advanced only — not the happy path |
| Pipeline | One aggregate → preview → Excel → PDF |
| Attraction data | Feeds VAR family |
| Hotel DOT registers | Feed DAE family via `fetchAeRegisterReportData` (attraction proxy only if labeled as gap/proxy) |

Extend `dot_report_preview`, `dot_report_export_service`, `dot_report_pdf_export`, `DotReportExportPanel` — do not fork exporters.

## Establishment DOT register (implemented — extend, don't rebuild)

1. Hotel logs in → **Register** tab = DAE-1B Daily Register (one row = one occupied room-night). "Add stay" expands guests × nights into rows.
2. Monthly Record, DAE-2 summary, By Country are computed by `AeRegisterCalculator` (never typed).
3. Header `ae_monthly_reports/{aeId}_{yyyy}_{mm}` holds saved totals; `rows` subcollection holds the register. Hotel marks the month **submitted**.
4. LGU (Establishments tab) / OPTACA (registry) see `AeRegisterCompliancePanel` (submitted / draft / missing); Governor entity analytics embeds Insights. All open `AeRegisterViewerScreen` (read-only).
5. DAE forms read registers (drafts included with a gap note). Columns adapt via `AeRegisterSchema` (lodging first).

Retired: establishment QR stay requests, staff confirm queue, rooms tab, establishment reviews.

## Integration boundary

- Prefer **seeding** when demos need volume (`docs/TEST_ACCOUNTS_REPORTS.md`).
- Auth/routing shared — confirm before role→route edits.
- Firestore rules + tagged seeds (`seedTag`, `@misocc-seed.ph`).
- Supabase = report templates/storage only.
- Reuse EmailJS + FCM.

## Temporary seeding

LGU Debug data (tourists + demo hotel registers) → `tools/seed_dashboard_analytics.js` → `tools/seed_dummy_data.js` → cleanup tools. Seeds are replaceable.

## Do not confuse context with tasks

`Tourist → QR → LGU → OPTACA → Governor` does not mean implement every hop. Start in LGU / DOT / OPTACA (or the establishment register slice when asked).
